# Mobile (`mobile/`)

- **Stack:** React Native 0.84, React 19, TypeScript, **React Navigation** (stack + tabs), **NativeWind** v4, **Drizzle ORM**, **Zustand**, Firebase (Analytics, Messaging, Crashlytics, etc.).
- **Layout:** `src/app`, `entities`, `features`, `screens`, `widgets`, `shared` — path aliases in `tsconfig.json`.
- **Whisper:** `src/features/transcription/` + `src/shared/lib/whisper/`; serialize native calls via `whisperNativeLifecycle.ts`.
- **Meeting dialogue:** `src/screens/recording-detail/` (tab UI, `meetingSpeakerLabels`, roster); cloud regen in `src/features/ai-processing/lib/regenerateMeetingDialogue.ts`.
- **Bootstrap:** `src/features/app-lifecycle/model/useAppBootstrap.ts` — DB + stores before first screen; defer push/RevenueCat.
- **Database:** Drizzle (`yarn db:generate` runs `drizzle-kit generate`). Do not use Prisma inside `mobile/`. Recent columns: `meetingSpeakerLabels`, `cloudAiJobId` on `records`.
- **Styles:** NativeWind / Tailwind-like utilities; respect `dark` mode as in existing screens.
- **Animations:** `react-native-reanimated` + `react-native-worklets` — follow worklet rules (not everything can run on the UI thread).
- **Native modules:** when adding dependencies, verify iOS/Android setup (Pods, permissions); `patch-package` runs on `postinstall` — keep patches under `patches/`.
- **Checks:** from `mobile/`: `yarn lint`, `yarn type:check`, `yarn test`.

Do not use DOM/Web APIs (`window`, `document`, Next-style CSS modules). Icons: `lucide-react-native`, not `lucide-react`.
